{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22357","headline":"惜栯李花 · 白居易","name":"惜栯李花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"树小花鲜妍，香繁条輭弱。\n高低二三尺，重叠千万萼。\n朝艳蔼霏霏，夕凋纷漠漠。\n辞枝朱粉细，覆地红绡薄。\n由来好颜色，常苦易销铄。\n不见莨荡花，狂风吹不落。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}